# What: paths excluded from the public template repo.
#   graphify-out/ and .obsidian/ are regenerable; venv/ is local tooling.
#   viewer/node_modules and viewer/dist are maintainer-only build artifacts —
#   viewer/README.md documents rebuilding assets/graph-viewer.template.html
#   (which IS committed) from them.
# Test: after a user runs bootstrap.sh, `git status` stays clean of these.
venv/
.venv/
graphify-out/
.obsidian/
.DS_Store
viewer/node_modules/
viewer/dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
